1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,491
Bakit hindi umaabot sa
rated watts ang panels mo?

2
00:00:03,841 --> 00:00:06,611
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,961 --> 00:00:11,171
Ang rating ay galing sa lab
test: standard test conditions.

4
00:00:11,271 --> 00:00:17,601
1000 W/m² na liwanag at
25°C na cell temperature.

5
00:00:17,901 --> 00:00:21,081
Sa totoong bubong,
mas mainit ang panels,

6
00:00:21,131 --> 00:00:24,521
at kapag mas mainit,
bumababa ang output.

7
00:00:24,821 --> 00:00:28,851
May epekto rin ang anino,
alikabok, at anggulo ng araw.

8
00:00:29,151 --> 00:00:32,501
Kaya normal na mas mababa
ang aktwal kaysa rating.

9
00:00:32,901 --> 00:00:38,071
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

10
00:00:38,421 --> 00:00:40,881
Life is SoLight with Solar.
